<td><h2>GLEX: Major global energy company TotalEnergies opts for Glex technology</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2023-06-22 09:52:13</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Glex - a groundbreaking software company focusing on advanced analysis and collaboration through data visualisation - today announced that Glex has been awarded a contract with TotalEnergie, a multi-energy company that produces and markets energies on a global scale.<br><br>The delivery includes our newly created Relinquishment Atlas App that gives users access to a set of curated exploration data through a streamlined web application. The app also features an AI-powered document search, delivered by a third-party.<br><br>TotalEnergie has the option to expand the project to include data from the UK Continental Shelf (UKCS), which will expand the project financially.<br>Glex’s CEO Jørgen Engen Napstad says: “TotalEnergie is a leading global company and has been a front-runner in the industry for decades. Being given the opportunity to develop new technology for such a sophisticated client is a huge milestone and a great opportunity for Glex.”<br><br>As a new service in our product portfolio both parties have the option to terminate the project after an evaluation period, due to normal business standards.<br><br>About Glex:<br><br>Glex AS is a software company that develops advanced analysis and collaboration tools for anyone working on industrial energy decisions, whether exploring or producing hydrocarbons, seabed minerals or exploiting offshore wind or potential reservoirs for carbon storage. Our SaaS Glex Energy® has been in development since 2017. The team consists of industry professionals with extensive experience and unique domain expertise, combined with data-science competence and software developers with a background in the gaming and visualization industry.<br><br>Contact:<br>Enquiries: contact@glex.no<br>CEO Jørgen Engen Napstad +47 934 06 526</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.glex.no">
http://www.glex.no</a>
&nbsp;
