<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Major step for Glex Energy® platform</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-05-27 10:09:41</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Glex has entered an agreement with M Vest Energy to develop a series of new functions within our data software platform Glex Energy®.<br><br>“This assignment is in line with our strategy to develop our services in close cooperation with our clients. Glex Energy's® next major upgrade will include data from oil and gas production, which can be monitored and analyzed in our asset overview”, says Jørgen Engen Napstad, CEO at Glex.<br><br>The project will contribute a positive net margin to Glex, but more important is the future value creation Glex Energy® can contribute to clients. Production data will be a standard option in the Glex Energy® Saas menu.<br><br>Jørgen Engen Napstad continues:<br>“Over the past months, we have strengthened our main product Glex Energy® significantly. The Glex business model depends on value-adding services, which in turn will provide long-term recurring revenues. Glex is currently working with several high-level industry players to expand the company’s range of services and raise the level of performance”.<br><br>About Glex:<br>Glex AS is a software company that develops advanced analysis and collaboration tools for anyone working on industrial energy decisions, whether exploring or producing hydrocarbons, seabed minerals or exploiting offshore wind or potential reservoirs for carbon storage. Our SaaS Glex Energy® has been in development since 2017. The team consists of industry professionals with extensive experience and unique domain expertise, combined with data-science competence and software developers with a background in the gaming and visualization industry.<br><br>Contact:<br>Enquiries: contact@glex.no<br>CEO Jørgen Engen Napstad +47 934 06 526</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.glex.no">
http://www.glex.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Glex joins forces with major data supplier</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-05-27 10:07:22</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>In line with Glex's ambitions to expand its services in the energy industry, the company enters into a Proof Of Concept (POC) period to make well data from an industry-leading data supplier available on the company’s Glex Energy® platform.<br><br>"The data supplier is a market leader in the energy industry and will strengthen its position as the company's well data will be immediately available at the Glex-user's fingertips. Glex's mission is to make the digital workflow easier and improve business decisions through easy access and striking computer visualization. With these proprietary data available in the Glex Energy® platform, we really accelerate our level of performance" CEO Jørgen Engen Napstad says.<br><br>Glex main product is Software as a service (Saas), focusing on planning, exploration, and business development. By adding well data and production data (seperate project) to the existing portfolio, Glex will significantly expand the range of services to the industry.The duration of the POC period is estimated to be 6 months. Glex will disclose the business model and economic impacts when or if the parties move forward with commercial cooperation.<br><br>About Glex:<br>Glex AS is a software company that develops advanced analysis and collaboration tools for<br>anyone working on industrial energy decisions, whether exploring or producing hydrocarbons, seabed minerals or exploiting offshore wind or potential reservoirs for carbon storage. Our SaaS Glex Energy® has been in development since 2017. The team consists of industry professionals with extensive experience and unique domain expertise, combined with data-science competence and software developers with a background in the gaming and visualization industry.<br><br>Contact:<br>Enquiries: contact@glex.no<br>CEO Jørgen Engen Napstad +47 934 06 526</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.glex.no">
http://www.glex.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Glex 2021 results</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-04-25 12:06:19</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The results for 2021 are in line with the planned budget and reflect Glex' focus on preparing the Glex Energy technology for new challenges in the energy sector. Please find the annual report for 2021 attached.<br><br>In 2021 Glex performed a large number of technological developments and improvements, with our existing customers. We rebranded our platform from Glex to Glex Energy, highlighting the shift in focus from exclusively oil and gas exploration to the wider energy industry, and started the development of new functionality within multiple new domains. We improved the platform's scalability, security, and infrastructure on Microsoft Azure Cloud Computing Services. In addition, Glex expanded the data resource base throughout the year and continues forward. <br><br><br>In October Glex raised NOK 17 million from >250 investors via Dealflow<br><br><br>December 20 Glex was listed on the NOTC marketplace.<br><br><br>Jørgen Engen Napstad, CEO commented: "The results for 2021 are in line with our plans and reflect our focus on developing the technology and marketing our software. We made strong progress during 2021, proving the scalability of our unique technology.” <br><br><br>In connection with the annual report, the Board of Directors also provided the following outlook statement:<br><br><br>2021 was a turning point in the development of Glex as a competitive software company, both technically and financially. The organization and technology are well prepared to onboard new clients and meet the demand for better data analysis and visualization capabilities. <br><br><br>2022 will be an exciting year for the company and it is the Board's assessment that Glex is well positioned and prepared to realize the current plans and its market potential.<br><br>Contacts:<br>Enquiries: contact@glex.no<br>Jørgen Engen Napstad, CEO Glex AS, e-mail: jorgen@glex.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
